■ INTUITUM
PROJECT: THULE

///

CONTACT: SUPPORT@INTUITUM.SH
LOCATION: USA
STATUS: DEVELOPMENT

///

OVERVIEW:
 - General-purpose microVM sandbox for isolated workloads.
 - Runs tools and processes inside a guest instead of on the host.
 - Intended for CLIs, coding agents, build workers, and other automation.
 - Standalone infrastructure, not an extension for one agent or harness.

///

BOUNDARY:
 - The guest receives only resources explicitly passed to it.
 - Host credentials and the rest of the host filesystem stay outside the guest.
 - Workspace sharing, process execution, and network access require explicit policy.

IMPLEMENTATION:
 - Scaffold only. No runtime or security boundary exists yet.
 - Language, guest image, runtime interface, and integration model remain open.

///

